# ComputeInForce: SemQL enricher on GovernanceRule of the GovernanceRules accelerator. Sets InForce to true when the rule is APPROVED, its effective date is reached and its retirement date, if any, is not reached; false otherwise.
_package: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.enrichers
_type: SemQLEnricher
_name: ComputeInForce
entity: GovernanceRules.entities.GovernanceRule.GovernanceRule
label: Compute In force
description: Sets InForce to true when the rule is APPROVED, its effective date is reached and its retirement date, if any,
  is not reached; false otherwise. Computed at certification.
enricherExecutionScope: PRE_CONSO
semQlEnricherExpressions:
- attributeName: InForce
  expression: SEM_CAST_BOOLEAN(CASE WHEN LifecycleStatus = 'APPROVED' AND EffectiveDate <= CURRENT_DATE() AND (RetirementDate
    IS NULL OR RetirementDate > CURRENT_DATE()) THEN 'true' ELSE 'false' END)
